WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.460
I used to have to handle

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.980
every message myself.

3
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.420
When messages came at night

4
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.780
or when I was busy,

5
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:06.580
I couldn’t keep up

6
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.570
with the volume.

7
00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.250
That’s a digital responder

8
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.130
in Turkey.

9
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.170
The field team:

10
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.160
two people.

11
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.920
So at Zogreo,

12
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.120
we ran a pilot.

13
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.880
Our AI leads each person

14
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.480
through three Bible studies,

15
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.680
answers their questions,

16
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.770
and follows up.

17
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.920
Those who finish,

18
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.440
and obey in faith,

19
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.800
are handed to the team

20
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.850
on the ground.

21
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.300
The result:

22
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.660
the same team could serve

23
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.590
3.73 times as many people.

24
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.260
And they found

25
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.540
disciple-making leaders

26
00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.030
at about the same rate.

27
00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:38.770
One more thing.

28
00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.210
Many who answer these ads

29
00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.170
are hostile,

30
00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:43.330
and responders take the abuse.

31
00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:44.290
In the pilot,

32
00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:45.970
our AI took it instead,

33
00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.650
and answered graciously.

34
00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.410
In the responder’s words:

35
00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.370
I don’t have to deal with

36
00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.850
inappropriate or profane comments,

37
00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.210
and I get to spend more time

38
00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:54.770
on the people

39
00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:56.260
that are most interested.

40
00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.400
Our AI doesn’t replace

41
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.280
the team.

42
00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.800
It multiplies them.

43
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.600
Book a call,

44
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.240
or give,

45
00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:05.300
at zogreo.org.
